This licence covers the CODE in this repository only. It does NOT cover the
input datasets, which are not redistributed here and which carry their own
terms that each user must accept for themselves:

  * ERA5 reanalysis (Hersbach et al., Copernicus Climate Change Service) and
    SEAS5 seasonal forecasts (ECMWF, via the Copernicus Climate Data Store) are
    distributed under the Copernicus Licence. Accepting the licence for each
    dataset in your own CDS account is a precondition of downloading it, and
    products derived from them must acknowledge the source. See
    README.md ("Data licences") for the wording and the links.
  * The ARCO-ERA5 mirror on Google Cloud (gs://gcp-public-data-arco-era5) is a
    reformatting of the same ERA5 data and carries the same Copernicus terms.

Neither ECMWF nor the Copernicus Climate Change Service is responsible for any
use of these data, or for the model output produced from them.
